{"id":"vod_sn_54927","vodId":"54927","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"魔奇少年","name_cn":"魔奇少年","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"HD","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20231112-1/eefc222a9dd55edc2a4d059db8182fe9.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在一个虚构的世界之中，在这里，突然之间出现了古代王朝遗迹群，人们称之为“迷宫”。在迷宫里，隐藏着数之不尽的宝物，而其中最为人津津乐道的，就是被称为“魔神金属器”的魔器。然而，想要得到这些宝物却并不是一件容易的事情，与之相伴的，是无处不在的危险和敌人。\r\n　　阿里巴巴（梶裕贵 配音）是一位乐于助人的善良青年，一次偶然中，他结识了名为阿拉丁（石原夏织 配音）的少年。一场意外让阿里巴巴背负上了巨额的债务，于是，他决定同阿拉丁，以及被其解放的怪力女奴隶（户松遥 配音）一起攻克传说中最复杂却也是隐藏了最多宝物的第七迷宫。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-11-12 17:42:03","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202311/12/mxpcWY02dQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202311/12/rz1S0R7p9q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202311/12/FLJu6p68MM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202311/12/Pk2fNNYRnu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202311/12/2ETnBBU9CX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202311/12/uETti4ZxNq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202311/12/4gZNcCfMQw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202311/12/8SYxzDNhdP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202311/12/gDVY1qujpN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202311/12/KGRsEVYDYL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202311/12/JmYRWwRR8d1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202311/12/Qe7R7FXBiy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202311/12/Xv5HC4Kpet1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202311/12/mMzYZRTMYB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.